    "body": "This is a really nice speed up have left a suggestion but other than that that this LGTM.\r\n\r\nOne thing to note is that from the docs it implies that `rustup default` might try to install the toolchain if it is not already installed but after testing with a fresh install it isn't the case if we are just checking what the default is\r\n\r\n```\r\n❯ rustup default --help\r\nrustup-default \r\nSet the default toolchain\r\n\r\nUSAGE:\r\n    rustup default [toolchain]\r\n\r\nFLAGS:\r\n    -h, --help    Prints help information\r\n\r\nARGS:\r\n    <toolchain>    Toolchain name, such as 'stable', 'nightly', or '1.8.0'. For more information see `rustup help\r\n                   toolchain`\r\n\r\nDISCUSSION:\r\n    Sets the default toolchain to the one specified. If the toolchain\r\n    is not already installed then it is installed first.\r\n```",
    "state": "COMMENTED",
